---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /faq/
title: FAQ
description: Answers on AEGIS PDNS protective DNS and our virtual CISO (vCISO) service — how DNS filtering over DoH, DoT and DoQ blocks malware, phishing and ransomware, and how we help you meet NIS2, DORA, SOC 2, ISO 27001 and GDPR.
---

<section class="page-hero fade-up">
  <p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p>
  <h1>Protective DNS &amp; vCISO, answered.</h1>
  <p class="lead">What AEGIS PDNS blocks, how we help you meet NIS2 and the other frameworks, and how to get started.</p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="stack faq-list">
    {% for item in faqs %}
    <details class="faq"{% if loop.first %} open{% endif %}>
      <summary>{{ item.q }}</summary>
      <p>{{ item.a | safe }}</p>
    </details>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <div class="btnrow" style="justify-content: center; margin-top: 28px;">
    <a class="btn primary" href="/contact/">Get in touch</a>
    <a class="btn" href="/#aegis">See what we do</a>
  </div>
</section>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {%- for item in faqs %}
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": {{ item.q | dump | safe }},
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": {{ item.a | dump | safe }} }
    }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
    {%- endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>
